   Earnest Money Deposit (non-refundable on assignment):
   {{ assignment_emd_formatted }} due within 2 business days of execution.

   Balance of {{ assignment_fee_balance_formatted }} due at closing of the PSA.

5. CLOSING

   Closing of the PSA shall occur on or before {{ closing_date }}. Time is of
   the essence. Assignee shall comply with all closing requirements under the PSA.

6. REPRESENTATIONS OF ASSIGNEE

   Assignee represents that: (a) Assignee has reviewed the PSA and accepts all
   of its terms; (b) Assignee has conducted or waives all due diligence;
   (c) Assignee has sufficient funds to close; (d) Assignee is not purchasing
   as a principal residence unless disclosed in writing.

7. ENTIRE AGREEMENT

   This Agreement constitutes the entire agreement between the parties regarding
   this assignment and supersedes all prior negotiations. Amendments require
   written consent of both parties.

8. GOVERNING LAW

   This Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of Indiana.

